WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.498
"How often do you play football?"

2
00:00:07.499 --> 00:00:09.833
"I sometimes play football.

3
00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:17.101
I play football on Wednesdays and Saturdays."

4
00:00:17.102 --> 00:00:20.413
"How often do you play baseball?"

5
00:00:20.414 --> 00:00:22.472
"I often play baseball.

6
00:00:22.473 --> 00:00:33.772
I play baseball on Wednesdays, Thursdays, Fridays, and Sundays."

7
00:00:33.773 --> 00:00:37.305
"How often do you play soccer?"

8
00:00:37.306 --> 00:00:39.436
"I always play soccer.

9
00:00:39.437 --> 00:00:46.966
I play every day."

10
00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:50.773
"How often do you play tennis?"

11
00:00:50.774 --> 00:00:53.569
"I never play tennis.

12
00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:57.348
I don't like it."

13
00:00:57.349 --> 00:01:07.991
"Then come play with me!"

